  pages     = "613--622",
  abstract  = "How closely related are two nodes in a graph? How to compute this
               score quickly, on huge, disk-resident, real graphs? Random walk
               with restart (RWR) provides a good relevance score between two
               nodes in a weighted graph, and it has been successfully used in
